L001365	In Fig.~\ref{fig:TnvsH} we show the same data as in Fig.~\ref{fig:TvsEpsdiffH} but as a function of $\mu_0H_z$ and at different values of $\varepsilon_{xy}$. This depiction stresses that the experimental data exhibits a kink at zero magnetic field, that can be attributed to the altermagnetic coupling to the conjugated field $\hat{h}$.
